      "Pathogenic variants in PROS1 gene",
      "Family segregation of mutations"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Exclusion of acquired causes such as vitamin K deficiency or liver disease",
      "Coagulation profile typically normal except protein S assays"
    ]
  },
